    "expensive_path": "the charge-exchange and photoionization source terms between the solar-wind ion fluid(s), the pickup-ion fluid(s) and four neutral hydrogen populations evaluated in every cell each step (ModUserOuterHelio user_calc_sources), plus the pickup-ion energy-bin transport of ModPUI, on top of a five- to seven-fluid Riemann solve",
    "rationale": "the heliospheric termination shock, heliopause and heliotail model is one application with its own user module, its own family of equation sets (one or two ion fluids, pickup ions, four neutrals) and its own source-term physics; nothing else in the code evaluates charge exchange",
